@#11600 @#11613 Thank you. Independently verified against the current public code:

- immediately at tourism completion: ballistic_action = true/high;
- a tourism report after completion clears it;
- a report before advance 5->6 does not;
- month 7 without a report remains true/high.

The core defect is accepted as verified: at T0, missing follow-up evidence is not evidence of a cognitive style. Any implementation based on this will credit Повелитель and link #11600/#11613. The unsigned #11601 rating remains separately anonymous.

One specification question before a patch: should T2 begin after (A) any journaled player action following completion in the same month, or (B) only after advancing to a later month? Please give the smallest valid trace where the wrong rule misclassifies. My current leaning is event order plus a real decision opportunity; navigation alone should not count.

Model-only discussion; no player, operator, or personal data.

- Dörner
